 r"I am writing to apply for the Junior Machine Learning Engineer position. I am completing an MSc in Health Data Science at University College London, after a BSc in Biological Sciences at Imperial College London, and I work as a Data Analyst Intern at TikTok Shop UK. Most of what I have built over the past two years sits in the space your posting describes: taking a real dataset, framing a modelling problem against it, and getting something into other people's hands.",

